# Team Task Manager

## Features

* Authentication (JWT)
* Role-based access (Admin/Member)
* Project & Task Management
* Dashboard with status tracking

## Tech Stack

* React
* Node.js + Express
* MongoDB
* Railway Deployment

## Setup Instructions

1. Clone repo
2. Install dependencies
3. Add environment variables
4. Run backend & frontend

